  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A society where student issues are heard and respected.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on ensuring representativity through a spesific focus on female participation, legitimacy and a non-violent advocacy. The project will offer core support incl. capacity building/training, democratic structure meetings, stakeholder engagements, HEI chapter mobilization meetings, female students&#x2019; summit, research, SRC election support, regional student union meeting.</narrative>
  </description>
